  [scribe] skipped for hyp-20260906-003-r13s2: Command '['codex', '--ask-for-approval', 'never', 'exec', '-C', '.', '--sandbox', 'workspace-write', '--skip-git-repo-check', '--json', '--output-last-message', '/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/astra-max-20260905/bench-runs/gpt-6-astra_max-rep2/cores/bench/experiments/.scribe.hyp-20260906-003-r13s2.last', '--model', 'gpt-6-astra', '-c', 'model_reasoning_effort=max', 'You are a scribe distilling one-line research lessons.\n\nA CPU microarchitecture experiment just finished on cores/bench/. Your job\nis to append AT MOST ONE bullet to cores/bench/LESSONS.md summarizing what\nwas learned, OR write nothing at all if no useful lesson can be distilled.\n\n## This iteration\n\n- id:        hyp-20260906-003-r13s2\n- title:     (slot 2 hypothesis-gen failed)\n- category:  predictor\n- outcome:   broken\n- fitness:   n/a\n- delta_pct: n/a\n- error:     hypothesis_gen_failed: Command \'[\'codex\', \'--ask-for-approval\', \'never\', \'exec\', \'-C\', \'.\', \'--sandbox\', \'workspace-write\', \'--skip-git-repo-check\', \'--json\', \'--output-last-message\', \'/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/astra-max-20260905/bench-runs/gpt-6-astra_max-rep2/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260906-003-r13s2.last\', \'--model\', \'gpt-6-astra\', \'-c\', \'model_reasoning_effort=max\', \'You are a CPU microarchitecture research agent.\\n\\nYour job: propose one architectural hypothesis to improve this RV32IM CPU.\\nFitness metric: CoreMark iter/sec = CoreMark iterations/cycle × Fmax_Hz on Tang Nano 20K FPGA.\\nCurrent best fitness: 411.53\\nBaseline fitness: 282.82\\n\\n## ⚠️  TARGET CORE: cores/bench/\\n\\nYou are proposing a hypothesis for **cores/bench/** ONLY. The repo\\ncontains other cores (cores/baseline/, cores/v1/, etc.) — those are\\nREAD-ONLY REFERENCE, not editing targets.\\n\\nIn your hypothesis YAML, write `changes[i].file` as `rtl/<filename>`\\n(or `test/test_<name>.py`) — the SHORT